ing swap measurement criteria**\n**Refining swap thrashing detection criteria**\n**Planning swap observation interval**\n**Assessing swap thrashing metrics**\n**Designing multi-sample swap delta check**"},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_015b9a9088ecdeea016a9f0af3890c87d09e6b7fd483f0b638","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"3ff50455-e87b-41e5-adff-b6a614ef6e7b","seq":13039,"startedSeq":12891,"endedSeq":13039,"timestamp":"1788807958Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"验收合同要求的是“无持续 swap / 无 swap thrashing”，不是“任一时刻 `memory.swap.current` 必须严格为 0”。当前脚本把一个 44.5 MiB resident 快照误当成持续抖动，属于门禁实现过严；但在放宽前必须证明它不是增长中的交换压力。先采集远端整机与现有 JI 服务的 swap 基线和短时间 swap-in/out 变化，确认是否存在持续 I/O；若稳定，则把门禁改成记录每个 JI cgroup 的起止 swap，并仅在固定驻留观察窗内持续增长时失败，同时保留绝对值证据。"},{"id":"tool-call-call_CZ7RracKdNCLfT1JSECnKDnU","kind":"toolCall","title":"PowerShell","status":"completed","toolCallId":"call_CZ7RracKdNCLfT1JSECnKDnU","sessionId":"3ff50455-e87b-41e5-adff-b6a614ef6e7b","seq":13046,"startedSeq":13040,"endedSeq":13046,"timestamp":"1788807960Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":"PowerShell","toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"assistant-thought-root-resp_0be0c28d02e96283016a9f0b2fd44087d0b23de4b1eb4fc8cd","kind":"thoughtDelta","sessionId":"3ff50455-e87b-41e5-adff-b6a614ef6e7b","seq":13055,"startedSeq":13048,"endedSeq":13055,"timestamp":"1788807990Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"**Identifying zsh path overwrite causing command failures**\n**Planning sustained swap usage measurement over time**\n**Refining swap growth failure criteria**\n**Defining swap thrashing criteria**\n**Clarifying container memory and swap limits**\n**Planning swap sampling documentation update**\n**Planning targeted swap stability recheck**\n**Writing and planning swap inspection script**"},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_0be0c28d02e